    "ciesin:harvard_doi": "10.7910/DVN/XETUHW",
    "ciesin:sedac_doi": "10.7927/H4RR1W66",
    "ciesin:purpose": "To provide information on the number of amphibian species present at a one-kilometer spatial resolution which can be used in modeling efforts, wildlife conservation planning, natural resource management, policy-making, biodiversity studies and human-environment interactions.",
